  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/heritage.svg
  Description: Your ancestors lived in the trees and fished in all the waters of
    Tian Xia. You gain your choice of the following benefits. Once made, this choice
    can't be changed. You can climb any banyan. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Combat
    Climber] feat, and if you roll a success on the Athletics check to Climb, you
    get a critical success instead. You can catch any fish. You gain a swim Speed
    of 15 feet.
